"guide.thTotal":"Total available",
"guide.duelScoringNote":"13 is deliberately odd, so a week can never end in a draw. <b>7 points wins outright</b> — once your alliance is mathematically there, remaining phases can be skipped and items banked for next week. Saturday alone is worth 4, so a week can still be swung on the last day.",
"guide.duelRulesHead":"Entry &amp; settlement",
"guide.duelRule1":"Matching runs every Sunday; the alliance needs <b>20 members</b> and a <b>top-32 might rank</b> to be entered.",
"guide.duelRule2":"Each day settles at <b>00:00 server time</b> (GMT&minus;2).",
"guide.duelRule3":"Reward stages 4–9 stay locked until the corresponding <b>Alliance Duel technology</b> is researched — worth doing before chasing high stages.",
"guide.duelRule4":"Switching alliance mid-duel forfeits <b>alliance</b> points for that day; personal points are still earned.",
"guide.duelEraWarn":"<b>Era 1 guide:</b> it describes some activities that have not reached kingdom #217 yet (for example Exclusive Weapon shards and hero awakening materials). The task lists above come from in-game screenshots of our own server and are what actually applies here.",
"guide.canyonTitle":"Canyon Conquest &mdash; format",
"guide.canyonSrc":"Source: the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18qbFy4vsTFNxDn1NZ71rsp1YVtmkc1f2F_vJbRFMPvU/edit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Alliance Events</a> player guide (same document as the Alliance Duel block). Player-written. English-only for now.",
"guide.canyon1":"<b>Registration</b> — alliances sign up during the registration window.",
