"guide.canyon3":"<b>Preparation</b> — a fixed window before fighting opens, used to set rally leads and marches.",
"guide.canyon4":"<b>Battle</b> — runs <b>5 days</b>, round-robin: each alliance in the group faces each of the others.",
"guide.canyon5":"<b>Settlement</b> — standings lock and rewards are distributed.",
"guide.canyonWarn":"<b>Not live on #217 yet.</b> This is an Era 1 feature and the card above is still a placeholder — no confirmed local times. The format is listed here so the alliance knows what to expect when it does unlock.",
"guide.elixirTitle":"Event structure",
"guide.elixirSrc":"Source: the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1mrx4pgivvV23wdzfOFWGorquADvD6jLdL41eZX5Fo5g/edit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Elixir Scramble – Event Guide</a> spreadsheet (owner chengtinyong, last edited 29 Apr 2026), transcribed from screenshots. English-only for now.",
"guide.elixirIntro":"A 30-minute alliance-vs-alliance points event. Both <b>alliance points</b> and <b>personal points</b> are tracked, and they are earned by different actions.",
"guide.elixir1":"<b>1 &middot; Matching</b> — opponents are paired.",
